{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"f0f41f6abe06e4f3cd2967a3215b61263745e9f073032cbde2d432818d3cc491","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"5fdaa1aef1474e60e3f20e6344d2b8747cae2b71ea6034d1a222e4e4ca21b228","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"The source says 'plus %d%% of your total entropy each turn', but the target has '你当前熵的 %d%%' and drops 'total'. In the frozen snippet (tome-cults/data/talents/demented/entropy.lua L228-229, source unpinned, sha256 e8046402…), edam = (eff.power * eff.dur) * t.getEntropyBonus, so the base is power × remaining duration: the total entropy left, not the current per-turn value. '当前熵' can be read as the per-turn value, and it also repeats the '当前' in '（当前 %d）'. Suggest '你的熵总量'."},{"revision_key":"e1cabcc547c9824bc2acce4b89632094d92a5c8e200e6ce7b81b8b64c2176009","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"The second sentence adds a spatial scope that is not in the source. The source says 'The highest atrophy stack found will be used for the spell speed calculation' (tome-cults/data/talents/demented/chronophage.lua L166, source unpinned, sha256 6b669e4e…). The target says '会使用你周围最高层数的衰亡效果'. Nothing in the source or the frozen snippet L162-167 supports a range limit of '你周围'; the first sentence ties the stacks to the target you apply atrophy to. This adds a mechanism condition with no evidence. Suggest '将以找到的最高衰亡层数计算施法速度'."}]}